### Create customer
POST http://localhost:8080/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarah",
  "email": "sarah@example.com"
}

### Get all customers
GET http://localhost:8080/customers

### Get customer by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/customers/999

### Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/products/999

### Create order
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1
}

### Create order with nonexistent customer
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 999
}

### Get all orders
GET http://localhost:8080/orders

### Get order 1
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/999

### Create order with items
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

